      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.arkansas.com/regions-cities/cities/jasper",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Little Buffalo River winds through Jasper’s center, providing swimming holes and fishing for bass and catfish.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.arkansas.com/regions-cities/cities/jasper",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "An elk herd of about 600 roams the river corridor, making Jasper a prime spot for wildlife viewing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
